  "description": "UnlimitedPDF is an enterprise-grade, pure .NET PDF library for creating PDF documents with text, tables, images, headers, and footers, merging, splitting, and extracting or removing pages of existing PDFs, and converting HTML to PDF, saved to a file or a stream. No third-party dependencies.",
